ontent\": {\"text\": \"开发者-1 在线 ✅（实例 ta_0000000012，角色 developer）\\n收到 @all 自报信息：开发者Agent已就绪，负责编码实现与问题排查，可处理指派 issue（开发→自测→resolve）。当前任务 smoke-mtqqt6xi-issue-host，开始执行后可配合架构师设计稿与测试者验证清单推进开发工作。\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [{\"type\": \"all\"}], \"senderId\": \"a_developer\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T05:25:32.232Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000012\"}}','2026-09-07 05:25:32.237'),('ev_0000000060','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000013\"}','2026-09-07 05:25:32.276'),('ev_0000000061','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000008\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"项目经理-1 自报信息 ✅\\n- 角色：project_manager（项目经理）\\n- 实例 id：ta_0000000014\\n- 工作目录：/data/vteam-worker/项目经理\\n- 职责：任务拆解与排期、Issue 编排、进度跟踪与风险提示，协调产品/架构/开发/测试各环节衔接\\n- 能力：read/doclib/issue 管理等；写操作与验收判定需成员确认，不越权验收\\n在线连通正常，随时可接派工作项。\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"a_project_manager\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T05:25:32.312Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000014\"}}','2026-09-07 05:25:32.322'),('ev_0000000062','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000009\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"@all 自报信息：我是【架构师-1】（实例 ta_0000000011，角色 architect）。负责基于需求文档输出技术方案与设计文档：技术选型、架构分层、模块划分、关键流程、数据模型、风险与权衡。代码仓库只读核查，不直接改代码。接收需求/方案更新后产出设计文档，@ 开发者衔接实现。需要方案时 @ 我即可。\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [{\"type\": \"all\"}], \"senderId\": \"a_architect\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T05:25:33.634Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000011\"}}','2026-09-07 05:25:33.644'),('ev_0000000063','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000014\"}','2026-09-07 05:25:33.964'),('ev_0000000064','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000010\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"测试-1 自报信息 ✅\\n- 角色：测试（tester）\\n- 职责：用例设计、执行验证、边界场景穷举、缺陷 Issue 流转\\n- 就绪：文档库/群聊/定向通知通道正常，随时可接收验收标准与实现说明开展验证\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"a_tester\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T05:25:34.319Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000015\"}}','2026-09-07 05:25:34.331'),('ev_0000000065','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000015\"}','2026-09-07 05:25:35.503'),('ev_0000000066','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000012\"}','2026-09-07 05:25:35.996'),('ev_0000000067','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 05:25:35.997'),('ev_0000000068','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000011\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"当前任务是什么，可对任务的操作有哪些\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"u_admin\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T05:27:55.305Z\", \"senderType\": \"user\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": null}}','2026-09-07 05:27:55.327'),('ev_0000000069','chat.message.new','team','tm_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000011\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"当前任务是什么，可对任务的操作有哪些\", \"parts\": []}