0000292','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000059\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"@all 我（架构师-1）当前可用的技能（skill）有 2 个：\\n1. prototype-designer：原型页面设计——按平台 TSX 规范编写 React 组件原型并提交，文档站「原型」tab 编译渲染。适用于需要产出原型/UI 稿/页面示意时。\\n2. customize-opencode：编辑/创建 opencode 自身配置（opencode.json、.opencode/ 下文件、agents/skills/plugins/MCP/权限规则），仅用于 opencode 配置相关，不用于本项目应用代码。\\n\\n另有能力工具：代码仓库只读（git_clone/pull/log/diff/status）、文件检索（read/grep/glob）等。需要原型设计时 @ 我即可。\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [{\"type\": \"all\"}], \"senderId\": \"a_architect\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:24:54.669Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000011\"}}','2026-09-07 07:24:54.680'),('ev_0000000293','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 07:24:56.770'),('ev_0000000294','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000060\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"读一下原型设计这个，看看里面写了什么\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"u_admin\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:33:38.933Z\", \"senderType\": \"user\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": null}}','2026-09-07 07:33:38.946'),('ev_0000000295','chat.message.new','team','tm_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000060\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"读一下原型设计这个，看看里面写了什么\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"u_admin\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:33:38.933Z\", \"senderType\": \"user\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": null}}','2026-09-07 07:33:38.952'),('ev_0000000296','agent.loading','task','t_0000000003','{\"phase\": \"thinking\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000003\", \"agentId\": \"a_architect\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\", \"instanceId\": \"tmm_0000000003\"}','2026-09-07 07:33:38.988'),('ev_0000000297','agent.loading','task','t_0000000003','{\"phase\": \"operating\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000003\", \"agentId\": \"a_architect\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\", \"instanceId\": \"tmm_0000000003\"}','2026-09-07 07:33:39.093'),('ev_0000000298','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"running\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 07:33:39.105'),('ev_0000000299','agent.loading','task','t_0000000003','{\"phase\": \"thinking\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000003\", \"agentId\": \"a_architect\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\", \"instanceId\": \"ta_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 07:33:39.117'),('ev_0000000300','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000061\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"@all 已读取 prototype-designer（SKILL.md，v2.0.0）内容要点：\\n\\n【定位】原型页面设计技能：按平台 TSX 规范写 React 组件原型，经 submit_artifact 提交后文档站「原型」tab 自动编译渲染，无需改代码/部署。\\n\\n【工作流】分析需求(task_context)→设计结构→编写 TSX→自检→submit_artifact(type=file)→复查。\\n\\n【TSX 规范】每个原型={<kebab-name>/index.tsx}，必须导出 meta{id,name} + export default function；仅允许 import react + @proto/shared（业务组件 AgentAvatar/AgentBadge/ChatBubble/StatusBadge/Sidebar/TopBar、导航 NavDock/NavTopBar、UI 控件等）；样式用 tailwind + 品牌/语义色阶；交互仅 useState；数据全部写演示值；禁止第三方库/API/网络请求。\\n\\n【提交】fileRef 指向工作目录 <kebab-name>/index.tsx，type=file 提交。\\n\\n【嵌入文档】原型可经 ```prototype{id,title,device,height}``` 围栏嵌入 markdown、@prototype[id] 行内引用、```prototype-list``` 列清单，文档站 iframe 渲染支持 PC/移动切换。\\n\\n【原理】esbuild-wasm 编译 TSX → iframe srcdoc 沙箱渲染（仅 allow-scripts，无网络/存储）→ 数据链路 DocsMirrorService 镜像 + PrototypeSandbox 编译。\\n\\n需要做界面原型/UI 稿时 @ 我即可。\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [{\"type\": \"all\"}], \"senderId\": \"a_architect\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:34:21.756Z\", \"senderType\": \"agent\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": \"ta_0000000011\"}}','2026-09-07 07:34:21.764'),('ev_0000000301','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"idle\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 07:34:24.388'),('ev_0000000302','chat.message.new','channel','c_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000062\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"你测试一下这个原型工具的流程是否能跑通\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"u_admin\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:34:54.546Z\", \"senderType\": \"user\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": null}}','2026-09-07 07:34:54.557'),('ev_0000000303','chat.message.new','team','tm_0000000001','{\"message\": {\"id\": \"m_0000000062\", \"status\": \"sent\", \"content\": {\"text\": \"你测试一下这个原型工具的流程是否能跑通\", \"parts\": []}, \"mentions\": [], \"senderId\": \"u_admin\", \"channelId\": \"c_0000000001\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-07T07:34:54.546Z\", \"senderType\": \"user\", \"attachmentUrl\": null, \"attachmentName\": null, \"attachmentType\": null, \"senderInstanceId\": null}}','2026-09-07 07:34:54.563'),('ev_0000000304','agent.loading','task','t_0000000003','{\"phase\": \"thinking\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000003\", \"agentId\": \"a_architect\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\", \"instanceId\": \"tmm_0000000003\"}','2026-09-07 07:34:54.582'),('ev_0000000305','agent.loading','task','t_0000000003','{\"phase\": \"operating\", \"taskId\": \"t_0000000003\", \"agentId\": \"a_architect\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\", \"instanceId\": \"tmm_0000000003\"}','2026-09-07 07:34:54.624'),('ev_0000000306','session.updated','task','t_0000000003','{\"status\": \"running\", \"workerId\": \"w_compose_worker\", \"sessionId\": \"s_0000000011\"}','2026-09-07 07:34:54.